---
// Replaces Starlight's ThemeProvider. The site is dark only: the app's locked skin has no light
// palette, and boards draw on the dark substrate. This sets the dark theme before the page first
// paints, whatever localStorage or prefers-color-scheme say. Starlight's scripts still call
// StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers, so it stays defined and does nothing.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
